[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13680.87, "timestamp": "03:48:00", "text": "我们自己。我的意思是，如果你不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13682.55, "timestamp": "03:48:02", "text": "你的年龄，意味着你老了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13685.03, "timestamp": "03:48:05", "text": "好的。如果你不知道自己的年龄，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13689.59, "timestamp": "03:48:09", "text": "老的。嘿，嘘。好的。我已通过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13690.55, "timestamp": "03:48:10", "text": "大部头书。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13693.59, "timestamp": "03:48:13", "text": "声音可以再大一点。喜欢，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13695.59, "timestamp": "03:48:15", "text": "你知道他们常说的那种话吗，“我是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13700.07, "timestamp": "03:48:20", "text": "永远18岁。”我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13703.189, "timestamp": "03:48:23", "text": "每天都游走在合法边缘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13704.79, "timestamp": "03:48:24", "text": "现在呢？现在呢？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13707.189, "timestamp": "03:48:27", "text": "现在差不多吧？我觉得自己好像刚成年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13709.83, "timestamp": "03:48:29", "text": "我越看越觉得……哦不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13713.349, "timestamp": "03:48:33", "text": "你这是在逆生长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13716.389, "timestamp": "03:48:36", "text": "我的天，这还是同一个世界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13718.95, "timestamp": "03:48:38", "text": "乔，发生什么事了？一切皆是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13720.95, "timestamp": "03:48:40", "text": "同一个词？调整一些东西。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13722.71, "timestamp": "03:48:42", "text": "记住我的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13724.87, "timestamp": "03:48:44", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13728.07, "timestamp": "03:48:48", "text": "好吧，看来我得去西部打球了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13730.469, "timestamp": "03:48:50", "text": "如果这款游戏对我们不起作用怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13734.229, "timestamp": "03:48:54", "text": "全部？我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13736.15, "timestamp": "03:48:56", "text": "闭嘴。该死的。请邀请我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13738.64, "timestamp": "03:48:58", "text": "请邀请我。 是的。你好。"}]